{"id": "import-poisson-20261106-demo", "topic": "人生，像一场泊松过程", "language": "zh", "durationSeconds": 67.83333333333333, "points": [{"id": "import-point-1", "text": "人生像一场泊松过程", "claims": ["人生像一场泊松过程"], "evidence": []}, {"id": "import-point-2", "text": "大多数时间处在等待中", "claims": ["大多数时间处在等待中"], "evidence": []}, {"id": "import-point-3", "text": "在独处中打磨自己，在坚持中完善自我", "claims": ["在独处中打磨自己，在坚持中完善自我"], "evidence": []}, {"id": "import-point-4", "text": "机遇到来，果断出击，抓住机会", "claims": ["机遇到来，果断出击，抓住机会"], "evidence": []}, {"id": "import-point-5", "text": "跨越式成长，抵达新的人生阶段", "claims": ["跨越式成长，抵达新的人生阶段"], "evidence": []}], "segments": [{"text": "很多人都误以为,人生是一个周而复始的循环,在起伏中不断的打转。", "at": 9.7, "time_span": [1.62, 9.7], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "但其实人生的本质,它其实是一场泊松的过程。", "at": 14.1, "time_span": [10.1, 14.1], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "我们的人生大多数时刻都处在一个漫长且未知的等待当中。", "at": 20.04, "time_span": [14.6, 20.04], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "这段时光或长或短,看似平淡无波。", "at": 25.62, "time_span": [21.16, 25.62], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "但请相信所有沉寂的时光都绝对不是虚度", "at": 30.66, "time_span": [25.62, 30.66], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "而是默默的沉淀为我们自己积蓄力量的一个过程", "at": 35.3, "time_span": [31.12, 35.3], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "我们在独处中打磨自己", "at": 37.46, "time_span": [35.3, 37.46], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "在坚持中完善自我", "at": 39.66, "time_span": [37.46, 39.66], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "静静地为机遇蓄力", "at": 42.02, "time_span": [39.66, 42.02], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "当合适的一个契机突然出现并且降临", "at": 46.44, "time_span": [42.58, 46.44], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "我们就要果断出击", "at": 47.98, "time_span": [46.44, 47.98], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "牢牢抓住这个机会", "at": 50.02, "time_span": [47.98, 50.02], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "然后就能实现我们跨越式的跳升和成长", "at": 53.88, "time_span": [50.02, 53.88], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "来突破我们原有的圈层", "at": 56.42, "time_span": [53.88, 56.42], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "一跃抵达新的人生阶段", "at": 60.1, "time_span": [57.72, 60.1], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}, {"text": "然后可以推开我们属于自己崭新广阔的世界大门", "at": 64.74, "time_span": [60.1, 64.74], "source": "imported-subtitle", "timingQuality": "provided-subtitle", "asrConfidence": 1}]}